Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;03-26-01 10:18<br>
<br>Any place that allows you to complain about somebody else becomes a flame center.  I probably should have been more detailed in what I was talking about.  If you look at <a href="http://www.lanys.com">the Lanys server</a>, they have a shitlist, which is basically just a message board that allows players to list those people they believe to be dinks.  Ninja looters, for example, would be considered grief players, where as a druid not sowing you or porting you or (insert other annoying request here), is not considered being a grief player.  Rules of moderation on the board seem to be pretty tight, and it looks like a pretty fair way of doing things.  Anyhow, it was just a thought, we still have no idea if anything like this will be implemented by us.</font></tt><p>
</td>
