Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;04-04-01 03:08<br>
<br>I think that it would have to be a well established pattern of annoyance to earn a spot on that list. I can think of only maybe 3 individuals that would earn a place on it and 2 of them are no longer either playing that character or playing EQ. If you're going to brand someone with something like this, youd better set some serious high standard of shame to make it. Dont make it something to be used cavalierly or to get even with someone or to execute a vendetta, thats my only sincere concern.<br>
<br>
Sincerely, leaf</font></tt><p>
